title: Remove executed PSM migration on WAH
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Removes the `RemovePallet<Psm>` and `RemovePallet<Parameters>` migrations added in #12245
    from the Westend Asset Hub runtime.

    Both already ran on Westend Asset Hub (spec 1_025_000). Since `RemovePallet` runs on every
    upgrade, leaving them in would wipe any PSM created from now on.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: major
